  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leading the field -  The International Treaty on Plant Genetic Resources for Food and Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This proposal is aimed at mobilizing support for the third cycle of call for proposals of the BSF. The priorities of the Call will focus on supporting initiatives that promote food security and crop adaptation to climate change for vulnerable smallholder farmers. Investments are channeled to projects meeting the criteria established by the Treaty?s Governing Body and which an internationally respected scientific counsel and an intergovernmental policy framework support.</narrative>
  </description>
